<title>USA: Sherwin-Williams to acquire Thompson Minwax.</title>
<headline>Sherwin-Williams to acquire Thompson Minwax.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sherwin-Williams Co said Friday it has a definitive agreement to acquire Thompson Minwax Holding Corp for $830 million in cash.</p>
<p>The deal, which is with affiliates of the private investment firm of Forstmann Little &amp; Co, is expected to close in late 1996.</p>
<p>Forstmann had acquired Thompson Minwax brands, a line of stains and varnishes, from Eastman Kodak Co in 1994 for $700 million.</p>
</text>
